Phases: PHASE1, PHASE2; Conditions: ['Lung Cancer', 'Non-Small Cell', 'Metastatic Squamous Cell Carcinoma', 'Metastatic Non-Squamous Cell Carcinoma']; Drug: ['adxs-503', 'pembrolizumab']; Eligibility Criteria: Inclusion Criteria:

