Phases: PHASE1, PHASE2; Conditions: ['Advanced Hepatocellular Carcinoma (HCC)']; Drug: ['mgd013 monotherapy', 'mgd013 in combination with brivanib alaninate']; Eligibility Criteria: Inclusion Criteria:

1. Subjects who voluntarily sign the informed consent form (ICF);
